		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thin mustard-colored shelf fungus that absorbs magic and controls minds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 spore (near) +5 (mind drain), <strong>MV</strong> close (climb), <strong>S</strong> -1, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Devour Magic</strong>. Spells cast in near of fungus have DISADV. If failed, regains 2d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mind Drain</strong>. 1d4 INT damage, mindless servitor at 0 INT.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mind Drain Aura</strong>. All mortals within near, WIS 15+ or 1d4 INT damage, mindless servitor at 0 INT.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
